<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.67 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.53 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.86 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Sales		   13.79 vs  12.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.62 vs   2.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.54 vs   3.75</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.02 vs   5.78</p>
<p> Sales		  155.88 vs 114.51</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
